This distribution contains the kap-core, kap-android and kap-compose release
module closure copied from the local Hanna repository's library-teyes/kap
working tree, including the frozen Region implementation for 1.0.0-alpha01.
Production Kotlin/C/C++/shader source bytes and tests are retained exactly.
Standalone release settings, publishing metadata, the reduced dependency
catalog and license-resource packaging are Prism-specific release glue.
PROVENANCE.json in the parent snapshot directory records the source commit,
local modifications, per-file hashes and the precise redistribution boundary.

Auditable source distribution:
https://github.com/kaus-io/prism-motion/tree/main/thirdparty/prism-sdk/kap

kap-android includes Zstandard common/decompression source, licensed under the
BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
The complete original notice is retained at
kap-android/src/main/cpp/third_party/zstd/LICENSE and redistributed in native
Android artifacts as META-INF/prism-sdk/kap/kap-android/ZSTD-LICENSE.
The KAP MIT license is redistributed as META-INF/prism-sdk/kap/{module}/LICENSE;
each module uses its own path so applications can merge all SDK artifacts.
No precompiled JNI libraries are included in this source snapshot.
